					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Out of curiosity, where was it established that 343 couldn't see ANY SCP's? I remember the Tale from the Bright Side establishing that he couldn't see 682, but I haven't seen anywhere say that he can't see SCP's in general. I've been looking for that point for a while, as it doesn't seem like the kind of thing that just spontaneously generates.</p> 
